msgid "Learn about the transpiler for the latest version of Samplomatic"
msgstr "Alamin ang tungkol sa transpiler para sa pinakabagong bersyon ng Samplomatic"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler"
msgstr "Transpiler"

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpiler {#transpiler}"
msgstr "Transpiler {#transpiler}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") function is a flexible and convenient tool to build a [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) that can group the circuit instructions into annotated boxes. This gives an easy alternative to manually grouping and annotating circuits, and is useful for automating a workflow, testing different circuit boxing strategies, and so on.\n"
msgstr "Ang function na [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") ay isang flexible at maginhawang tool para bumuo ng [`qiskit.transpiler.PassManager`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.transpiler.PassManager) na kayang i-group ang mga circuit instruction sa mga annotated na box. Nagbibigay ito ng madaling alternatibo sa mano-manong pag-group at pag-annotate ng mga circuit, at kapaki-pakinabang sa pag-automate ng workflow, pagsubok ng iba't ibang estratehiya sa pag-box ng circuit, at iba pa.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide illustrates how to use [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") and its arguments. To highlight the effects of each of the function’s arguments, the following sections mainly refer to the circuit below.\n"
msgstr "Inilalarawan ng gabay na ito kung paano gamitin ang [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") at ang mga argument nito. Para i-highlight ang epekto ng bawat argument ng function, pangunahing tinutukoy ng mga sumusunod na seksyon ang circuit sa ibaba.\n"

