# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Incorporate Samplomatic’s pass manager into Qiskit preset pass managers {#incorporate-samplomatics-pass-manager-into-qiskit-preset-pass-managers}"
msgstr "Isama ang pass manager ng Samplomatic sa mga preset pass manager ng Qiskit {#incorporate-samplomatics-pass-manager-into-qiskit-preset-pass-managers}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The code below shows how to incorporate [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") into a Qiskit preset pass manager. The transpiled circuit is ISA and contains boxes.\n"
msgstr "Ipinapakita ng code sa ibaba kung paano isama ang [`generate_boxing_pass_manager()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/samplomatic/auto/transpiler-generate-boxing-pass-manager#samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager \"samplomatic.transpiler.generate_boxing_pass_manager\") sa isang preset pass manager ng Qiskit. Ang na-transpile na circuit ay ISA at may mga box.\n"

