# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This pattern also combines naturally with the barrier-based ISA boxing workflow. The boxing pass manager runs as a post-scheduling step, after barriers from the original logical circuit have survived transpilation, so they guide stratification as expected.\n"
msgstr "Natural ding naisasama ang pattern na ito sa barrier-based na ISA boxing workflow. Tumatakbo ang boxing pass manager bilang post-scheduling step, matapos manatili ang mga barrier mula sa orihinal na logical circuit sa transpilation, kaya ginagabayan nito ang stratification gaya ng inaasahan.\n"

