msgid "In another example, a right-dressed box is added to collect the virtual gates that would otherwise remain uncollected due to the unboxed measurements.\n"
msgstr "Sa isa pang halimbawa, nagdaragdag ng right-dressed box para kolektahin ang mga virtual gate na maiiwang hindi nakolekta dahil sa mga hindi na-box na measurement.\n"

